      "source": "This class can be declared as a standard bean if you run a lot of custom repositories\nin which you use either the <a href=\"../../core/ReactiveNeo4jTemplate.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.neo4j.core\"><code>ReactiveNeo4jTemplate</code></a> or the\n<a href=\"../../core/ReactiveNeo4jClient.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.neo4j.core\"><code>ReactiveNeo4jClient</code></a>.",
      "translation": "如果运行大量自定义仓库，且这些仓库中使用了 <a href=\"../../core/ReactiveNeo4jTemplate.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.neo4j.core\"><code>ReactiveNeo4jTemplate</code></a> 或 <a href=\"../../core/ReactiveNeo4jClient.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.neo4j.core\"><code>ReactiveNeo4jClient</code></a>，则可以将此类声明为标准 Bean。",
