      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/aop/framework/autoproxy/AbstractBeanFactoryAwareAdvisingPostProcessor.html#setBeanFactory(org.springframework.beans.factory.BeanFactory)\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.aop.framework.autoproxy\">setBeanFactory</a></code> in class <code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/aop/framework/autoproxy/AbstractBeanFactoryAwareAdvisingPostProcessor.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.aop.framework.autoproxy\">AbstractBeanFactoryAwareAdvisingPostProcessor</a></code>",
