    {
      "source": "Bean post-processor that automatically applies persistence exception translation to all\nmethods returning either <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Mono.html\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.core.publisher\"><code>Mono</code></a> or\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Flux.html\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.core.publisher\"><code>Flux</code></a> of any bean marked with Spring's @<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/stereotype/Repository.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.stereotype\"><code>Repository</code></a> annotation, adding a corresponding <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/aop/support/AbstractPointcutAdvisor.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.aop.support\"><code>AbstractPointcutAdvisor</code></a> to the\nexposed proxy (either an existing AOP proxy or a newly generated proxy that implements\nall of the target's interfaces).",
      "translation": "这是一个自动为所有返回 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Mono.html\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.core.publisher\"><code>Mono</code></a>` 或  \n`<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://projectreactor.io/docs/core/release/api/reactor/core/publisher/Flux.html\" title=\"class or interface in reactor.core.publisher\"><code>Flux</code></a>` 的方法应用持久化异常翻译的 Bean 后处理器，适用于所有标记有 Spring 的 `@<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/stereotype/Repository.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.stereotype\"><code>Repository</code></a>` 注解的 Bean。该处理器会向暴露的代理（无论是现有的 AOP 代理还是新创建的、实现目标类所有接口的代理）添加相应的 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/aop/support/AbstractPointcutAdvisor.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.aop.support\"><code>AbstractPointcutAdvisor</code></a>`。",
      "count": 1
    }
